{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free demo version that includes the first two days of survival as the caretaker of the polar station from the full version of <strong>White Noise: Ghost Signal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric 2D adventure combining survival, exploration, and psychological drama. The deeper you dive into the routine of the polar station, the more questions arise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival in Harsh Conditions:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been assigned as the caretaker of a remote polar station. Your only connection to headquarters is an old radio \u2014 through it, you'll receive tasks to keep the station operational.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the unforgiving winter environment, you\u2019ll have to take care not only of the station, but of yourself:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood and maintain precious warmth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the workbench to craft essential survival tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps for rabbits, catch fish, and gather berries to keep yourself fed.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dreams and the Subconscious:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, headquarters gives you new tasks. Once they\u2019re completed \u2014 you\u2019re allowed to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every night, your subconscious takes you to strange places where you must uncover the truth, step by step\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044600?t=1758791188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044600?t=1758791188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044600/53e7882ee15bb0cf16d9fb6b7696a5a80515c716/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758791188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044600/53e7882ee15bb0cf16d9fb6b7696a5a80515c716/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758791188","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free demo version that includes the first two days of survival as the caretaker of the polar station from the full version of <strong>White Noise: Ghost Signal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric 2D adventure combining survival, exploration, and psychological drama. The deeper you dive into the routine of the polar station, the more questions arise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival in Harsh Conditions:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been assigned as the caretaker of a remote polar station. Your only connection to headquarters is an old radio \u2014 through it, you'll receive tasks to keep the station operational.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the unforgiving winter environment, you\u2019ll have to take care not only of the station, but of yourself:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood and maintain precious warmth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the workbench to craft essential survival tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set traps for rabbits, catch fish, and gather berries to keep yourself fed.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dreams and the Subconscious:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, headquarters gives you new tasks. Once they\u2019re completed \u2014 you\u2019re allowed to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every night, your subconscious takes you to strange places where you must uncover the truth, step by step\u2026</p>","developers":[" AliceoffGame"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3905700","name":"White Noise: Ghost Signal"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044600/60d